'''Hapoel Nir Ramat HaSharon Football Club''' ({{langx|he|מועדון כדורגל הפועל ניר רמת השרון}}) is an Israeli [[association football|football club]] based in [[Ramat HaSharon]]. Founded in 1957, the club is currently competing in [[Liga Alef]], and plays its home matches at [[Grundman Stadium]]."}}
